    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">thēlygŏnon</span></b> ,
			i, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλυγόνον</span> (producing females). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A species of the plant</i> phyllum, <i><span class="en">Plin. 26,
				15, 91, § 162</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A species of the</i> Satyrion, <i><span class="en">Plin. 26,
				10, 63, § 99</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A species of the</i> crataeogonos, <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 8,
				40, § 62</span></i>.</div>
